{"file_id":"LANG_MYOUTER_STAFF_COMMENT.OLANG","resource_class":"STAGEDAT_OLANG","part":4,"range":"150-199","status":"TRANSLATED_PENDING_CSV_MERGE","translations":[{"unique_index":150,"cn_text":"“我、我在El Cenagal一带的沼泽里看见了奇怪的脚印……\n怪、怪物……？”","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":98,"review_flag":"EL_CENAGAL_PLACE_NAME_PRESERVED; MONSTRUO_SEMANTICS_LOCALIZED"},{"unique_index":151,"cn_text":"“‘遇到麻烦就按START按钮！’\n这是我以前部队早会时的问候语！！\n队长……不知道现在还好吗。”","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":133,"review_flag":"JPN_MORNING_ASSEMBLY_AND_COMMANDER_MEMORY_PRESERVED"},{"unique_index":152,"cn_text":"“听说执行任务时，有办法让人把道具和弹药送过来……”","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":78,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":153,"cn_text":"“想要更高‘RANK’的武器，就得拿到相应的‘设计图’，还要提升‘研发班’的‘LEVEL’。\n看来任务和Mother Base，两边都不能偷懒……”","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":180,"review_flag":"RANK_LEVEL_MOTHER_BASE_FIXED_TERMS_PRESERVED"},{"unique_index":154,"cn_text":"“待在通常方法无法回收的地方的士兵，往往能力很强。应该还有什么办法能把他们回收回来……”","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":132,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":155,"cn_text":"“这里能容纳的人数也不是无限的。\n所以要尽量带最优秀的士兵回来。\n至少得有我这种水平。”","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":118,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":156,"cn_text":"“就算没有血缘关系，我们也是家人。\n如果不想让家人伤心，就活下来。”","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":93,"review_flag":"JPN_SURVIVE_TO_NOT_SADDEN_FAMILY_PRESERVED"},{"unique_index":157,"cn_text":"“不用Boss亲自出马……这里交给我。”","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":49,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":158,"cn_text":"“我想在这里攒钱，然后去美国上大学……”","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":60,"review_flag":"JPN_US_COLLEGE_GOAL_PRESERVED"},{"unique_index":159,"cn_text":"“我最喜欢‘烤’东西。所以吃的里面最喜欢炒面。\n日式烤鸡串也不错啊～”","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":98,"review_flag":"JPN_GRILL_WORDPLAY_PRESERVED"},{"unique_index":160,"cn_text":"“哎呀——大丰收，大丰收。\n今晚就用刚捕到的新鲜刺身，配冰镇的日本清酒喝一杯吧。”","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":118,"review_flag":"JPN_JAPANESE_SAKE_PRESERVED"},{"unique_index":161,"cn_text":"“今天不做也还有明天嘛～♪”","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":42,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":162,"cn_text":"“对开发者来说，没有比使用者的声音更好的营养了。”","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":72,"review_flag":"JPN_USER_VOICE_SEMANTICS_PRESERVED"},{"unique_index":163,"cn_text":"“我不讨厌这里的这种气氛。”","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":39,"review_flag":"AUX_OUTFIT_SUBSTITUTION_REJECTED; JPN_ATMOSPHERE_PRESERVED"},{"unique_index":164,"cn_text":"“我说过了吧！别把我当新人！”","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":45,"review_flag":"AUX_LAST_TIME_EXPANSION_REJECTED"},{"unique_index":165,"cn_text":"“198、199、200！哦，Boss，你来得正好！\n听我说，我刚刚连续做完了200个仰卧起坐。”","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":118,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":166,"cn_text":"“暂且让你当No.1吧，Boss。不过No.2就是我了，对吧？”","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":76,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":167,"cn_text":"“今天又要加班到深夜了……”","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":42,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":168,"cn_text":"“活得有棱有角一点，我觉得也没什么不好。”","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":60,"review_flag":"AUX_GRAB_LIFE_BY_HORNS_IDIOM_REJECTED; JPN_TONGATTE_NUANCE_PRESERVED"},{"unique_index":169,"cn_text":"“不干掉对方，就会被干掉！\n没错，这是正确的……在战争这种状况下……吧。”","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":100,"review_flag":"JPN_WARTIME_QUALIFIER_PRESERVED"},{"unique_index":170,"cn_text":"“我来当赚钱的主力。”","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":30,"review_flag":"AUX_BRING_HOME_THE_BACON_IDIOM_REJECTED; JPN_TOP_EARNER_PRESERVED"},{"unique_index":171,"cn_text":"“Boss！请下命令！！”","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":27,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":172,"cn_text":"“让他们活还是杀了他们，全看你……拜托了！！”","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":63,"review_flag":"JPN_LIVE_OR_KILL_CHOICE_PRESERVED"},{"unique_index":173,"cn_text":"“等这场战斗结束，我想开一家店。”","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":48,"review_flag":"JPN_SHOP_NOT_GENERIC_COMPANY_PRESERVED"},{"unique_index":174,"cn_text":"“啊……肚子……”","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":24,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":175,"cn_text":"“总之，放轻松点吧。”","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":30,"review_flag":"AUX_HAVE_FUN_EXPANSION_REJECTED"},{"unique_index":176,"cn_text":"“Boss是我们的希望！\n如果有人想夺走这份希望！\n哪怕力量不及，也只有战斗到底！”","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":111,"review_flag":"JPN_HOPE_AND_FIGHT_DESPITE_WEAKNESS_PRESERVED"},{"unique_index":177,"cn_text":"“你想让我忘了昨天的事……？已经晚了。我写进日记了。”","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":75,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":178,"cn_text":"“Boss，你来得正好。今晚正愁人手不够。\n接下来一起玩一局怎么样？”","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":90,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":179,"cn_text":"“每个人都有能做到和做不到的事。\n你做不到的由我们来做。\n所以你就去做我们做不到的事！！”","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":124,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":180,"cn_text":"“漂亮地解决吧。”","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":27,"review_flag":"JPN_SMARTLY_SEMANTICS_PRESERVED"},{"unique_index":181,"cn_text":"“哎呀，看来我的部下给你添麻烦了。失礼了。\n这个就请收下吧。”","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":87,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":182,"cn_text":"“我不能保证不干坏事，\n但难看的事我绝不会干。”","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":63,"review_flag":"JPN_COOL_UNCOOL_MORAL_NUANCE_PRESERVED"},{"unique_index":183,"cn_text":"“戒烟太简单了！我都戒过20次了。”","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":49,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":184,"cn_text":"“成为雇佣兵以前，我是医生。要不要试试我正在开发的药？”","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":78,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":185,"cn_text":"“我写出了一个很棒的故事！能告诉我你的感想吗？”","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":69,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":186,"cn_text":"“太棒了！这项研究一定会大获成功的，Boss！！”","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":61,"review_flag":"JPN_RESEARCH_SUCCESS_SEMANTICS_PRESERVED"},{"unique_index":187,"cn_text":"“如果我们以另一种方式相遇，说不定会成为最好的朋友。”","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":78,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":188,"cn_text":"“我从来没跟人打过架……”","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":39,"review_flag":"JPN_KENKA_FIGHT_PRESERVED; AUX_REAL_FIGHT_EXPANSION_REJECTED"},{"unique_index":189,"cn_text":"“放心，我做的饭100%安全、可靠。”","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":46,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":190,"cn_text":"“等这场战斗结束，我想重新做人……”","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":51,"review_flag":"JPN_KOUSEI_REHABILITATION_SEMANTICS_PRESERVED"},{"unique_index":191,"cn_text":"“……关键是伙食。饭够好吃，大多数人就不会抱怨。”","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":72,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":192,"cn_text":"“其实，我并不讨厌你……”","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":39,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":193,"cn_text":"“真希望能更早一点遇见你……”","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":45,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":194,"cn_text":"“每次见到你，你都会变得更漂亮。”","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":48,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":195,"cn_text":"“我回到故乡也算是个小有名气的记者。\n你的人生，我会好好记录下来的。”","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":96,"review_flag":"JPN_RECORD_YOUR_WAY_OF_LIFE_PRESERVED"},{"unique_index":196,"cn_text":"“换作我，会用更漂亮的方式完成！\n我就是这种类型！”","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":69,"review_flag":"JPN_SMART_CLEAR_SEMANTICS_PRESERVED"},{"unique_index":197,"cn_text":"“你的战斗方式，我并不讨厌。”","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":42,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":198,"cn_text":"“隐藏身形的那种刺激感，也别有一番滋味啊……”","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":66,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":199,"cn_text":"“我欠你一个人情。算了，我就陪你一起吧。”","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":60,"review_flag":""}]}